; name: Carved rosette
; group: Signs & inlays
; description: A round walnut plaque with a rosette carved in 3D relief from a height map (light stands high, dark goes deep): roughed out with a Ø6 end mill, leaving 0.4 mm, then finished with a Ø3 ball nose in 45° lines 0.3 mm apart, and cut out with an outside profile, held by tabs. Set the plaque’s diameter, the margin round it, the blank’s thickness, the relief depth and the tabs with the variables; load your own greyscale picture or STL model into the relief to carve something else.
; 
